    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「つい思わず、空手チョップをお見舞いしたせいでもあるんですけど☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「ど、どうりで頭だけじゃなくて首筋も痛いと思ったら……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「まぁ、追われてたんですもんね。怯えて、過敏になっちゃうのも仕方ないですぅ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「わたし貧血とか起こしやすいので、よく失神しちゃいますし♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「でもまぁ、気絶させちゃったのも申し訳ないとは思ったんですぜ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「それでピヨちゃんを介抱してたら、豪華客船のチケットを発見しましたので」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「代わりに乗船手続きをしといてあげよう、せめてもの罪滅ぼしに！　と思ったんですぜ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「ピヨちゃんが目覚めないうちに、船が出発しちゃいそうでしたしね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「あっしのせいで乗り遅れたとあっては、お天道さまに顔向けできません！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「はぁ、そういう事情でしたか……。代わりに手続きしてくれて、むしろ助かりましたよぅ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「わたし挙動不審なので、そういう手続きとかしてると不審がられるんですぅ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「でも何で、そこであえていかにも怪しい『密航者コース』なんてのを選んだんですぅ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「あと、なぜ榊さ……ぶちょうさんと、転こ……ジョンさんって呼んだほうがいいですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「ふたりも一緒に、豪華客船に乗ってるんですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「ええ。先ほども話したとおり、あっしは『けいどろ』の真っ最中で追われる身！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「ですがふつうに逃げても、アニキやアネゴからは逃げきれない！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「ゆえに、いっしょに船に乗せてもらおうと考えたわけですぜ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
